Guns don’t jam if their condition is higher than 70%. 

MP supported but (currently) not tested. Looking forward to your feedback❤️.

The threshold is customizable:
[list]
 [*] in singleplayer, customize the threshold under Options > Mods > Better Gun Jam. The change will take effect at once. 
 [*] in multiplayer, the server controls it through the sandbox settings and it will be shared with all players.
[/list]

Set the active threshold to 0% to prevent gun-jamming completely. (but why not do it in the sandbox settings instead? :)

Below the threshold, the jam chance will still be smaller than the vanilla's sandbox setting, and gradually increase as the condition decreases like the vanilla behavior.

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]
It should be compatible with ANY gun mod. If you worry about compatibility, enable it after any possible interfering mods.

[h1]Notes on B41[/h1]
In B41, you still need [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2169435993]Mod Options (Build 41)[/url] to configure the threshold.

[h1]More Info[/h1]
Source code hosted on [url=https://github.com/wsun-code/PZ_BetterGunJam]github.com/wsun-code/PZ_BetterGunJam[/url].

